        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Simei raengbang khou ai puai tat bam khou",
            "Hei khoutei neilamei chaeng phubam khou",
            "Theimei duipaeng khou kalang khuan chuna",
            "Pingmei rui alung khou nai e.",
            "",
            "He Jisu ata zai guanglou o",
            "Poubaomei chaeng maan na",
            "Maengtat bam khou.",
            "",
            "2. Pap taanmei suan mu theimei hei nade",
            "Airui theimei duipaeng kaanpat ngam mak",
            "Kumsini chaeng baimei mak Poubaomei",
            "Kanloumeipu nangta ninge.",
            "",
            "3. Tingkum heisan nang ta ganlou sini",
            "Kagan kathui nang zianmei zailou o",
            "Kabam kathui nang nade he Raguang",
            "Kandi khou thuanmei padik diu."
          ]
        }
      }
